        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Arthroscopy Association of North America. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Whereas hip arthroscopy plays a role in the investigation and treatment of the painful hip resurfacing arthroplasty, a diagnosis before arthroscopy is critical to improved outcome. The rate of conversion to total hip arthroplasty jumps from 7% to 37% when a pre-arthroscopy diagnosis is not known."
